conditional validation direction audit
  plain boolean unless: gate: schema and runtime agree on every quadrant
  declarative Symbol gate: schema and runtime agree on every quadrant
  gated subfield, canonical parent-presence condition: exact agreement
  blank same-key nested override: schema requires unconditionally (stricter-or-exact, never looser)
  top-level Proc gate: schema strictly requires; runtime accepts omission when the gate is closed
  coerced-boolean unless: reference: schema is now stricter-or-exact, never looser
  gated subfield, non-parent condition: the documented looser corner, and only that corner

